  <item>
    <title>Vol19.好好刷牙就是一种逆天改命｜年度金曲</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/688ba6ffedf3fa32d582988b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">688ba6ffedf3fa32d582988b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 02 Aug 2025 09:15:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>/本期话题/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>亲爱的朋友们，本期节目是一架来自半年前的时光机。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目录制于2025刚刚开始的冬天，我们在一起试图用一首歌总结2024，经过兵荒马乱的半年，它终于被香蕉树剪出来了。你还记得半年前的自己是如何想象这一年的吗？亲爱的蔬菜们，你的夏天还好吗？我很想念你们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你来听👏</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/菜市场/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> 紫薯《玉带桥》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">03:01</a> 过于敏感的神经末梢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 两个字：头疗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="747">12:27</a> 年轻的朋友们！我们现在正在人生的早上7点半啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="777">12:57</a> 年轻的朋友们早上7点半还没有起床</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="782">13:02</a> 香菜暴论：我们这个年纪其实该死了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 好好刷牙是一件很朋克的事情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 香菇《日光（苏打绿版）》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 一场等了五年的演唱会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 夏日祭典：烟花短暂但是足够美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> 土豆《before spring ends》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 神明让我告诉你：小心崴脚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1941">32:21</a> 香蕉树《number one girl》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a> 人类的深层魅力正是来自一点点自我犹疑，易碎的美让人低徊不已</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">35:42</a> 爱要大声说出来，因为坏人从不偷懒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2361">39:21</a> 土豆的“爱要坦荡荡”时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2547">42:27</a> 香菜《生活倒影》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> 存在主义危机的生活方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3131">52:11</a> 第100期蔬菜进屋大家都必须要参加！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3171">52:51</a> 你死后想变成什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3367">56:07</a> 胡萝卜《绝对无敌》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3568">59:28</a> 孢子甘蓝《close to you》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3633">01:00:33</a> 劲爆！孢子甘蓝2026年要结婚</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/关于我们/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！我们是蔬菜进屋，我们是一档由四位胡说八道的年轻人发起的闲聊播客，我们关心非必要、热爱无意义、擅长讲屁话、庆祝没出息，我们讨论与年轻人相关的一切小事，话题没有任何禁忌，如果你不嫌吵的话，就关注我们吧！</span></p>]]></description>
