  <item>
    <title>Vol17.只能说爱情和工作一样，都不是人生的必需品｜20岁爱情故事（2）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67066e7881cdab3a93cf6a07</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67066e7881cdab3a93cf6a07</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Oct 2024 11:52:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/本期话题/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>朋友们好久不见，夏天又要过完了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>蔬菜们打算再次谈谈爱情，距离上一次讲这个话题已经两年了。事到如今我们都有一些变化，空心菜在太平洋那头的悬崖上结婚了，即使隔着网线也为她感到幸福；紫薯和老鼠先生在大海这边家人般生活在一起；胡萝卜的爱情生活中出现了美妙的新人物；香蕉树、杏鲍菇、香菇、土豆...似乎都在没法被定义的迷宫里走来走去，无忧无虑地向四周伸出试探的触角。幸好我们都还愿意谈论爱情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>请开始听吧！👏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/菜市场/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a> 恭迎空心菜回屋！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">07:31</a> 主要是想办婚礼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 19.9的婚纱照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 问就是刚毕业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 为什么爱情会成为蔬菜进屋最受欢迎的节目？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 爱情的爱是爱上班的爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 留下的只有尴尬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1413">23:33</a> 萝卜の恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1697">28:17</a> 五元の恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 人生中总要有一次花火大会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 我们的轰轰烈烈病痊愈了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 人生就是被扇巴掌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">55:10</a> 成长就是不断背叛的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3389">56:29</a> 夏天人的酶很固执，灵魂的酶像荷花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3444">57:24</a> drama！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3668">01:01:08</a> 没有激女捅破天，哪有普女可开窗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3782">01:03:02</a> 爱像一只熊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4681">01:18:01</a> 断背山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4810">01:20:10</a> 这个世界上比爱情重要的事太多了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5044">01:24:04</a> Ryan</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>/关于我们/</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！我们是蔬菜进屋，我们是一档由四位胡说八道的年轻人发起的闲聊播客，我们关心非必要、热爱无意义、擅长讲屁话、庆祝没出息，我们讨论与年轻人相关的一切小事，话题没有任何禁忌，如果你不嫌吵的话，就关注我们吧！</span></p>]]></description>
