  <item>
    <title>Vol11.其实我的梦都是尊嘟！｜白日梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d87550e490c5dee54c42d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d87550e490c5dee54c42d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 13 Aug 2023 06:16:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>/本期话题/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题从一场“幻想中”的真实旅行出发，聊聊我们的白日梦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“只要将幻想营造得足够结实、足够细致，就有可能和现实世界交融，在某处接通。如果我在幻想中被山林里跳出来的老虎吃掉，也许现实中的我也会消失。当幻想足够逼真，也就成了另一种真实。”</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>《夜晚的潜水艇》</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你来听👏</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/菜市场/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a> “当幻想足够逼真，也就成了另一种真实。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 土豆的东北奇幻旅行是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> 红月亮与土豆教都是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="998">16:38</a> 彩虹游乐场是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1074">17:54</a> 沙滩上的屁股印是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 电影院是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 长途飞机上的蓝色聊天是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1517">25:17</a> 窗外飘过的画稿是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 在后海划船是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 胡萝卜要去追求的新世界是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1991">33:11</a> 如何使用厕所的拍摄灵感是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">35:20</a> 我是女明星是尊嘟！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 喝毒药的一家人、吃钢琴是尊嘟假嘟？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 撕考卷是连通异世界的钥匙🔑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a> 摩尔曼斯克警察局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2887">48:07</a> 别再来我梦里了！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> ✂🔞春梦之遥 午后之恋</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/本期歌单/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>一场游戏一场梦-王杰</span></p><span></span><p><span>梦中人-王菲</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/关于我们/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！我们是蔬菜进屋，我们是一档由四位胡说八道的年轻人发起的闲聊播客，我们关心非必要、热爱无意义、擅长讲屁话、庆祝没出息，我们讨论与年轻人相关的一切小事，话题没有任何禁忌，如果你不嫌吵的话，就关注我们吧！</span></p>]]></description>
