    <pubDate>Tue, 02 May 2023 15:17:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>/本期话题/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>热烈祝贺蔬菜进屋终于在春天来临前更新了兔年的第一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目我们回忆起各自的童年时光，分享了一些或荒谬、或快乐、或悲伤、或困惑的往事。在迈入社会的初期回看人生初始的样子，是看清了自己的来路还是平添伤感呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>反正，蔬菜们荒谬的人生早在大概2岁就写好了，超级好笑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你来听！👏</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/菜市场/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 超有才华的开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> 该如何形容你，我的童年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 阳光灿烂的幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="453">07:33</a> 一些充满怨念的词语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 摸摸兔兔肚肚不疼？？到底有没有人在听我讲话啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> 腌渍过的杨梅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1222">20:22</a> 毛茸茸的无聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a> 榕树下的老公 们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1799">29:59</a> 风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2097">34:57</a> 童年回忆之我有你没有</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 摔与被摔 受伤的可能性大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2525">42:05</a> 怎么从小就活在别人眼里啊你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 怎么从小就吃坏男人的苦啊你！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3118">51:58</a> 土启强的童年往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">01:00:00</a> 海港、孩子与神仙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5038">01:23:58</a> 头痛欲裂的下午和野蛮生长的三角钢琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5150">01:25:50</a> 唯一纯白的小茉莉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6168">01:42:48</a> 光明🚬共和国</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/本期音乐/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>3 Gymnopédies-i. Lent Et Douloureux</span></p><span></span><p><span>请你唱个歌吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>月亮船</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>/关于我们/</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>蔬菜进屋是一档由四位胡说八道的年轻人发起的闲聊播客，我们关心非必要、热爱无意义、擅长讲屁话、庆祝没出息，我们讨论与年轻人相关的一切小事，话题没有任何禁忌，如果你不嫌吵的话，就关注我们吧！</span></p>]]></description>
