    <title>Vol5.把爱说的那么浪漫我们都被骗了｜20岁爱情故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/637aff157105b234344c0c3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">637aff157105b234344c0c3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 21 Nov 2022 04:31:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>/本期话题/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目录制于一个冬日即将来临的夜晚，我们聊了聊</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>爱情。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们互相倾诉，提到了很多人、很多爱、很多时刻、很多疑惑、欢笑和眼泪。能说的、不能说的，我们都说了个够。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们刚刚20出头，我们还将爱上更多人，希望我们都能拥有爱人的能力，也希望我们能永远不把爱当作一场博弈，计较得失与方式，希望我们还能够全心全意，不留后路。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>希望我们都能永远喜欢笨拙的方式。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎你来听👏</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/菜市场/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">2:50</a> 欢迎新嘉宾，无心美女，空心菜🥬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">4:16</a> 爱情到底有什么特别的啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">5:16</a> 爱情是一瞬间颁发的通行证</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">5:55</a> 杏鲍菇 《火山挚恋》《柔软》：理解是爱的同义词</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">9:30</a> 爱是拓展认知边界的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 初恋故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="735">12:15</a> 福师大爱情学院院长👩‍🎓的初恋故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="786">13:06</a> 🥕在摩尔庄园里结婚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="859">14:19</a> 失恋就是反复阳性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 紫薯在亲密关系里的「得失心」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1037">17:17</a> &nbsp;杏鲍菇是爱情保安</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> 🍠：在是我男朋友之前他首先是我最好的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 水瓶座是一个胡说八道的星座吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 分手的时差</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">26:47</a> crush瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a> 杏鲍菇的象限理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1762">29:22</a> 为了听八卦发了太多誓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 提前跟我们的男听众道歉🙇‍♀️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 鲜花、干涸的河床、漆黑的无名江边、巨轮和月亮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2237">37:17</a> 然而共你已再无破晓</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2422">40:22</a> 空心菜：撞破南墙终成挚友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 北海公园、即将拆迁的咖啡馆、星座运势和童年的梦境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 少年感、笨拙、可爱、错觉、幻想和落日飞车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 理想的亲密关系就是幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 恋爱脑？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">56:50</a> 齐泽克：爱情是基于双方都做好了共同缔造一个世界的准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3511">58:31</a> 故事fm：火山边上相拥，我们在哪里 哪里就是家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 好的爱情：在亲密关系中喜欢自己</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/本期音乐/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>呼吸决定-Fine乐团</span></p><span></span><p><span>私奔到月球-五月天/陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>水瓶座-陈晓东</span></p><span></span><p><span>太聪明-陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>私奔-曾轶可</span></p><span></span><p><span>倾城-陈奕迅</span></p><span></span><p><span>最天使-曾轶可</span></p><span></span><p><span>Minor Blue</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋恋风尘-程璧</span></p><span></span><p><span>Our Story (我们的故事 )-Tension</span></p><span></span><p><span>在雨中 (Live in Hong Kong - 2012)-谭咏麟/杜丽莎</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>新桥恋人</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqalMypO1MoncAT4TvgSeEknSnka.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>火山挚恋</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuhnt-GGFkZmZTI8UWli7qj-74Xd.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>倾城</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FibMY7Kp9EfrpfX-wjU50giLtuS0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>紫薯微博</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBM1KjPmUIPT5-pyDmIVqkEsLTd.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>/下期预告/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>年终盘点，蔬菜春晚</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>/关于我们/</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大家好！我们是蔬菜进屋，我们是一档由四位胡说八道的年轻人发起的闲聊播客，我们关心非必要、热爱无意义、擅长讲屁话、庆祝没出息，我们讨论与年轻人相关的一切小事，话题没有任何禁忌，如果你不嫌吵的话，就关注我们吧！</span></p>]]></description>
